  "title": "Absolutely Delicious Green Bean Casserole from Scratch",
  "description": "This green bean casserole, entirely made from scratch, combines green beans, mushrooms, and onions in a creamy homemade sauce—no canned soup required!",
  "authors": [
    "Auriel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2005-11-15T10:08:55-05:00",
